[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14829.99, "timestamp": "04:07:09", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14831.67, "timestamp": "04:07:11", "text": "想象一下一块写着“随机呼叫”的牌子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14834.71, "timestamp": "04:07:14", "text": "羞愧难当。哦，等等。好的。哦，好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14837.99, "timestamp": "04:07:17", "text": "主意。我见过一些主播有这种情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14840.07, "timestamp": "04:07:20", "text": "随机代码装置作为床头板"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14841.75, "timestamp": "04:07:21", "text": "命令。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14844.55, "timestamp": "04:07:24", "text": "就像他们的版主补充道的那样。如果我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14847.03, "timestamp": "04:07:27", "text": "这样做吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14851.83, "timestamp": "04:07:31", "text": "是的，这完全可行。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14855.03, "timestamp": "04:07:35", "text": "好主意。我的天啊。我们将在……中这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14859.269, "timestamp": "04:07:39", "text": "未来的工作流程。今天就到这里。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14868.63, "timestamp": "04:07:48", "text": "我当时在做什么？我为什么又来这里了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14871.83, "timestamp": "04:07:51", "text": "啊，复制。我来了。我们来这里是为了复制"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14873.51, "timestamp": "04:07:53", "text": "这。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14876.07, "timestamp": "04:07:56", "text": "嘿，把直播公告粘贴过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14878.63, "timestamp": "04:07:58", "text": "这边。"}]